    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d558">

                <pb facs="0544" n="532" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg532"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 European War 1939/151: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-11-15T20:00:00+01:00">November 15,
                            1939—8 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 8:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2058. My 2043, November 14, 1 p.m.<anchor n="7" xml:id="d558-f1"/> A DNB
                    announcement just issued states as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Ribbentrop received the Belgian Ambassador and the Netherlands Minister
                            today. He advised the Envoys of Belgium and the Netherlands in the name
                            of the Fuehrer that after the brusque rejection of the peace offer of
                            the Belgian King and the Netherlands Queen by the British and the French
                            Governments the German Government considers these proposals as disposed
                            of.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <pb facs="0545" n="533" xml:id="pg533"/>
                <p>The Belgian Ambassador and Netherlands Minister were received at the Foreign
                    Office shortly after 6:00 p.m. today.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
